# Re-include docs/features/: api/routers/admin.py's architecture page reads
# these Markdown files at runtime. Docker evaluates .dockerignore patterns in
# order, so this negation must come after the broader "docs" exclusion above
# to take effect — a negation before the pattern it overrides is a no-op.
!docs/features/
